description:
Design a circuit that reverses the byte order of a 32-bit input word. The module extracts each of the four 8-bit bytes, rearranges them in reverse order, and then combines these reversed bytes into a single 32-bit output. This functionality allows for operations that require byte reordering, useful in data processing and manipulation applications.
module top_module(
    input [31:0] in,
    output [31:0] out
);

