description:
Implement a 4-bit XOR circuit that takes two 4-bit wide inputs, A and B, and produces a 4-bit wide output, Y. Each bit of output Y is the result of the exclusive logical OR operation on the corresponding bits of inputs A and B. The design utilizes multiple stages of XOR gates to accumulate the results effectively from individual bit pair-wise XOR operations.
module top_module(
    output [3:0] Y,
    input [3:0] A,
    input [3:0] B
);

