description:
Design a 4-to-2 priority encoder that takes a 4-bit input and outputs the binary representation of the highest-priority active input. The module checks the inputs in descending order of priority, where input[3] has the highest priority and input[0] the lowest. The `encoded_output` generates a 2-bit code corresponding to the position of the highest active input, ensuring only one output is valid at any time based on the input conditions.
