description:
Design a custom logic gate that captures specific relationships between two inputs, a and b. This module first computes the negations of the inputs using NAND gates and then generates the difference between the inputs through an XOR operation. The final output is produced by NANDing the calculated difference with the inversed inputs, effectively implementing a function that combines these operations. This design could be seen as a specialized multi-input logic gate that evaluates conditions based on the inputs' values.
module top_module(
    input a,
    input b,
    output out
);

code:
module top_module(
    input a,
    input b,
    output out
);wire inv_a, inv_b, diff;

// Obtain the inverse of both inputs
nand (inv_a, a, a);
nand (inv_b, b, b);

// Obtain the difference between the inputs
xor (diff, a, b);

// Combine the difference and the inverse of the inputs to generate the output
nand (out, diff, inv_a, inv_b);

endmodule

